sequenceDiagram
  %% Source for 15-alerting-flow.html. Edit this file, then run ./scripts/render-diagrams.py.
  %% Directives: docs in diagrams/README.md (Updating diagrams).
  %% @subtitle Grafana rule files stay the single source; the bridge and OpenSearch monitors turn them into notifications
  %% @type database: G OS P
  %% @type external: CH
  participant G as grafana/alerting<br/>rule files
  participant SET as opensearch-setup
  participant BR as opensearch-bridge
  participant P as Prometheus
  participant OS as OpenSearch<br/>monitors
  participant CH as Alert channel
  actor OP as Operator

  SET->>G: read every rule
  SET->>OS: create one monitor per rule
  loop every minute
    BR->>P: evaluate each PromQL rule
    P-->>BR: result
    BR->>OS: write litellm-alert-state-*
    alt condition held for the full 'for' duration
      alt alert channel configured
        OS-)CH: notification, one-hour throttle
        CH-)OP: operator notified
      else no channel
        Note over OS: visible in the UI only
      end
    else condition not held
      Note over OS: no alert
    end
  end
